<title>JAPAN: Takachiho - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takachiho - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		     7		vs	    5.97</p>
<p> Operating	  176    million	  vs	   76    million</p>
<p> Current	    177    million	  vs	   54    million</p>
<p> Net		   56    million	  vs	   20    million</p>
<p> EPS		    9.01 yen	  vs	    3.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Takachiho Co Ltd is a top wholesaler of domestic trip souvenirs.</p>
